# The graph this engine is built from. The tree lives OUTSIDE the engine —
# <project>/<project>-tree/agi — so a normal clone of this repo never contains
# a tree and needs no pattern here. This single line exists only for the
# self-referential pair, where agi/agi-tree is a symlink back to the graph repo
# so that agi/agi-tree/agi resolves. No trailing slash: that would not match a
# symlink. Deliberately literal, not a `*-tree` glob — nothing else should be
# ignorable here, and a generic pattern would hide a real mistake.
agi-tree
